   "data": {
    "what_it_does": "Asian Paints sells paints, coatings, wallcoverings, adhesives, tools, kitchen solutions, and related home décor products (including rugs, furnishings, tiles, furniture, bath fittings, and sanitaryware) to homeowners, large projects, dealers, corporates, architects, interior designers, contractors, and influencers across India and internationally. The company also offers end-to-end design-to-execution services, residential painting services, and interior design services through a multi-channel distribution network of wholesalers, distributors, retail outlets, and e-commerce platforms.",
