     {
      "text": "The company delivers strong returns with ROCE of 26%, operating margin of 18.8% (up from 18.2% three years ago), low leverage at 0.21 debt-to-equity, and operating cash flow covering PAT 1.29x over three years.",
      "source_ids": [
       "SCR"
      ]
     },
     {
      "text": "Recent quarterly performance shows accelerating momentum with June 2026 quarter recording the highest revenue of ₹10,542 Cr and PAT of ₹1,559 Cr among the last four quarters.",
      "source_ids": [
       "SCR"
      ]
     },
     {
      "text": "Management's mid-single-digit value growth guidance was met with 4.9% delivered across all four tracked quarters, demonstrating execution credibility.",
      "source_ids": [
       "T:2025-11-01:p25"
      ]
     }
    ],
    "bear": [
     {
      "text": "Three-year growth remains stagnant with revenue CAGR of only 1% and PAT CAGR of 1.6%, indicating structural growth challenges.",
      "source_ids": [
       "SCR"
      ]
     },
     {
      "text": "Quarterly results show significant volatility with September 2026 revenue declining to ₹9,977 Cr and PAT to ₹1,085 Cr from June 2026 peaks of ₹10,542 Cr and ₹1,559 Cr respectively.",
      "source_ids": [
       "SCR"
      ]
     },
     {
      "text": "Multiple forward-looking management targets (8-10% volume growth, 8-10% FY27 growth, 3-4% price trajectory, double-digit category growth) have zero quarters of verified delivery, creating visibility risk.",
